  "comments": "<p>Coins dated 1929S and 1930S are known to be restruck on 1921-1924, KM#27 coins.<br>A 1929S as example:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/630232564fc89.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/630232564fc89.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Clearly underneath the Lion the imprint of the 1 of the predecessor in the planchet after which it came loose and the final strike occurred.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67292d80736bb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67292d80736bb.jpg\"></a></p><p>Ronald Beumer</p>",
